cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "JANNUS: brain metastasis segmentation for multi-site external validation"
message: "If you use JANNUS in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Clark
    family-names: Kirby
    email: crkirby@uark.edu
    affiliation: University of Arkansas
repository-code: "https://github.com/ckirby04/JANNUS"
abstract: >-
  JANNUS segments brain metastases from four co-registered MRI sequences
  (T1 pre-contrast, T1 post-gadolinium, FLAIR, T2) using a seven-model
  ensemble fused by a learned stacking meta-classifier. Version 1.50 is
  packaged for external cross-validation, providing dataset QC, run
  provenance with checkpoint verification, and reproducible FDA- and
  RANO-BM-aligned evaluation. Research use only; not a medical device.
keywords:
  - medical imaging
  - brain metastases
  - segmentation
  - MRI
  - deep learning
  - external validation
license: MIT
version: 1.50.0
date-released: "2026-08-05"
